   ],
   "width": 0,
   "height": 0,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "The dominant sequence transduction models are based on complex recurrent or",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.557,
    371.035
   ],
   "width": 324.7423043640002,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "convolutional neural networks that include an encoder and a decoder. The best",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    360.126
   ],
   "width": 324.2646973200001,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "performing models also connect the encoder and decoder through an attention",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    349.217
   ],
   "width": 324.26469732000004,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "mechanism. We propose a new simple network architecture, the Transformer,",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    338.308
   ],
   "width": 325.5146051160002,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "based solely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions",
   "transform": [
    9.763348,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    327.399
   ],
   "width": 324.2700771239999,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "entirely.",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    316.49
   ],
   "width": 32.934562332000006,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": false
  },
  {
   "str": " ",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    176.800562332,
    316.49
   ],
   "width": 6.007447800000002,
   "height": 0,
   "hasEOL": false
  },
  {
   "str": "Experiments on two machine translation tasks show these models to",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    182.928159088,
    316.49
   ],
   "width": 285.20253823199994,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "be superior in quality while being more parallelizable and requiring significantly",
   "transform": [
    10.0821512,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    305.581
   ],
   "width": 324.6150221863998,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "less time to train. Our model achieves 28.4 BLEU on the WMT 2014 English-",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    294.672
   ],
   "width": 325.9210791959997,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "to-German translation task, improving over the existing best results, including",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    283.762
   ],
   "width": 324.26469732,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "ensembles, by over 2 BLEU. On the WMT 2014 English-to-French translation task,",
   "transform": [
    9.763348,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    272.853
   ],
   "width": 325.51002231999985,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "our model establishes a new single-model state-of-the-art BLEU score of 41.8 after",
   "transform": [
    9.763348,
    0,
    0,
    9.9626,
    143.866,
    261.944
   ],
   "width": 324.43605404000004,
   "height": 9.9626,
   "hasEOL": true
  },
  {
   "str": "training for 3.5 days on eight GPUs, a small fraction of the training costs of the",
   "transform": [
    10.161852,
